  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your nerves fail, increasing your pain tolerance and general resilience.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Death sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain +1 spell point. You can spend a spell point as an immediate action to gain a +1 bonus to natural armor and DR/- for 1 round. For each necrosis feat you possess beyond this one, the natural armor bonus and damage reduction increase by 1 and the duration increases by 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Four Necrosis Feats:</strong> You gain half the normal benefit of this feat at all times (increasing to the full benefit when you spend a spell point).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/necrosis-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
